<title>SWITZERLAND: Holderbank details H1 sales by region.</title>
<headline>Holderbank details H1 sales by region.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million tonnes unless stated)</p>
<p>	   Switzerland</p>
<p> Cement and clinker	   1.065     vs    0.832</p>
<p> Aggregates		     1.629     vs    1.687</p>
<p> Ready-mixed concrete	 0.478     vs    0.466</p>
<p>	   Europe</p>
<p> Cement and clinker	   8.905     vs    7.858</p>
<p> Aggregates		    16.674     vs    17.963</p>
<p> Ready-mixed concrete	 4.181     vs    3.825</p>
<p>	   North America</p>
<p> Cement and clinker	   6.254     vs    5.868</p>
<p> Aggegates			5.473     vs    5.108</p>
<p> Ready-mixed concrete	 0.595     vs    0.614</p>
<p>	   Latin America</p>
<p> Cement and clinker	   7.122     vs    5.938</p>
<p> Aggregates		     3.786     vs    4.067</p>
<p> Ready-mixed concrete	 2.160     vs    2.271</p>
<p>	   Africa, Asia, Oceania</p>
<p> Cement and clinker	   4.912     vs    4.158</p>
<p> Aggregates		     5.493     vs    5.451</p>
<p> Ready-mixed concrete	 1.043     vs    0.987</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
